        <headline>Storm Warning issued September 25 at 6:05AM EDT until September 26 at 6:00PM EDT by NWS Upton NY</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...For the Gale Warning, northeast winds 20 to 30 kt with
gusts up to 35 kt and seas 8 to 12 feet. For the Storm
Warning, north winds 30 to 40 kt with gusts up to 50 kt and
seas 11 to 16 feet expected.

* WHERE...Sandy Hook NJ to Fire Island Inlet NY out 20 NM.

* WHEN...For the Gale Warning, until 6 PM EDT this evening. For
the Storm Warning, from 6 PM this evening to 6 PM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Storm force winds and hazardous seas will capsize or
damage vessels and reduce visibility.
</description>
        <instruction>Mariners should remain in port, alter course, and/or secure the
vessel for severe conditions.</instruction>
